#: includes/class-podai-chat-admin.php:292
msgid "Connect your store to the Pod.AI service. Your site gets its own key; only public product data, your policies and settings are sent. Orders stay in WooCommerce and are only read when a shopper gives the order number and e-mail."
msgstr "把店铺连接到 Pod.AI 服务。你的网站会获得独立密钥；只发送公开的商品数据、店铺政策和设置。订单留在 WooCommerce 中，只有顾客提供订单号和邮箱时才会读取。"

